{"id":"15f1f418de3165e2","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-pa-degree.md","title":"PA度的路径基刻画","display":"df-pa-degree — PA度的路径基刻画","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-pa-degree","aliases":["43-df-pa-degree"],"display":"df-pa-degree — PA度的路径基刻画","depends_on":["[[43-df-pi01class]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Definition 5.18.1 and Theorem 5.18.4, print pp.70–71 / PDF pp.90–91","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-pa-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-pa-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pa-degree — PA度的路径基刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 5.18.1 and Theorem 5.18.4, print pp.70–71 / PDF pp.90–91"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 与其特征集合识别。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>；集合性质作用于序列时依以下关系或已有共同oracle接口解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PADegree}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\ \\Bigl(\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists X\\in\\mathcal C\\ (X\\le_TA)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PADegree}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\mathcal C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\ \\Bigl(\\Pi^0_1\\operatorname{Class}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathcal C\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists X\\in\\mathcal C\\ (X\\le_TA)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用书中Theorem 5.18.4的等价路径基刻画内建PA度，避免为本书引入整套Peano算术外部原子。原定义是完整一致PA扩张的度；这两个表述的等价性作为书中定理依据，而非声称同义来自名称。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：Definition 5.18.1 and Theorem 5.18.4, print pp.70–71 / PDF pp.90–91。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi01class]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnc